  "result": "Fixed. `IntRange._clamp` in `src/click/types.py` moved the wrong way for open bounds: it returned `bound - dir`, so a value below an open `min` clamped to `min - 1`, and a value above an open `max` clamped to `max + 1`. Both fall outside the allowed range. It now returns `bound + dir`, giving `min + 1` and `max - 1`.\n\nI added two cases to `tests/test_types.py` covering clamping with `min_open` and with `max_open`. `tests/test_types.py` passes (43 passed, 2 skipped). I didn't run the full suite.",
